---
source: crates/biome_css_analyze/tests/spec_tests.rs
expression: invalidDynamicShorthand.css
---
# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.dynamic-shorthands {
	padding: var(--spacing) 2px;
	margin: calc(var(--spacing)) 2px;
	inset: env(safe-area-inset-top) 1px;
	scroll-margin: attr(data-offset) 2px;
	margin: if(media(width > 1px): 1px 2px; else: 0) 3px;
	padding: 3px if(media(width > 1px): 1px 2px; else: 0);
}

```

